RFC 3986 section 5.2.2
is that if the path of the relative URI is empty, then the entire path of the base URI is to be used:
if (R.path == "") then
           T.path = Base.path;
           if defined(R.query) then
              T.query = R.query;
           else
              T.query = Base.query;
